2026-07-28 14:15:03.191 | INFO     | api.analytics_chat:analytics_module_chat:71 - Triggering Analytics Agent for Vendor: 6054690d-f545-43a9-83ab-d2435abfdeaf | Module: 6361cf82-2b1a-4570-b8fc-dfa2d456ca02
2026-07-28 14:15:06.454 | INFO     | services.sql_agent.agent_tools:retrieve_schema:51 - retrieve_schema: No relevant SQL schemas found. Raw data: [{'id': 'cbcddb27-a3b9-494e-985a-0054dfa0eb93', 'content': "BUSINESS RULES & LOGIC: \n1. Auto-Deduction Trigger: The employee's leave balance is only officially deducted from their quota *after* the request is explicitly marked as 'Approved'. While in 'Pending' state, the balance remains unchanged but the days are flagged to prevent double-booking. \n2. Rejection Remarks: If an approver chooses to 'Reject' a leave request, they are mandatorily required to enter a reason in a remarks text box, which is then emailed back to the employee for transparency. \n3. Multi-Level Approvals: Depending on company configuration, a leave may require two-tier approval. For example, it must first be approved by the Direct Reporting Manager; only then will it escalate to the Head HR (HHR) for final approval. \n4. Cancellation Policy: An employee cannot cancel an already 'Approved' leave if the start date has passed. If they need it revoked, the Head HR must manually adjust the leave ledger.", 'similarity': 0.673481820492389}, {'id': '198759b2-84d5-429e-b96c-58889965397b', 'content': 'The Leave Applications dashboard provides employees with a comprehensive overview of their time-off metrics. At the top of the interface, employees can view their current leave balances, categorized by specific leave types, showing total accrued leaves, leaves already used, and the remaining available balance. To submit a new time-off request, navigate to the leave application form. Begin by selecting the desired Leave Type from the dropdown menu, then specify the Start Date and End Date of your absence. A text area is provided to enter a detailed Reason for your leave. For certain leave types, such as Maternity Leave or extended Sick Leave, providing supporting documentation is mandatory. Use the file upload component to attach the necessary medical documents. Please ensure that the uploaded file size does not exceed the maximum limit of 1 MB. After reviewing the entered details and attachments, submit the form to forward your request to your manager or HR for approval.', 'similarity': 0.670959752123664}, {'id': 'de2eb9f2-a58e-4356-94e5-2b6040e677b5', 'content': "The Leave Approvals interface is designed for Managers and Head HRs to efficiently process employee time-off requests. Upon accessing the module, you will be presented with a comprehensive Data Table containing all leave applications. To easily manage your workflow and locate specific requests, you can utilize the global search bar or apply column-specific filters. For instance, you can use the status column filter to display only 'Pending' requests requiring your attention. Each row in the Data Table represents an individual leave application and includes a dedicated actions menu. By interacting with these row actions, approvers can quickly execute decisions such as 'Approve' or 'Reject' for the respective request. Additionally, a 'View Attachments' action is available, allowing approvers to seamlessly open and inspect any supporting medical documents or files submitted by the employee prior to making a final approval decision.", 'similarity': 0.662698854756552}]
