2026-07-28 14:18:10.896 | INFO     | services.sql_agent.agent_tools:retrieve_schema:60 - retrieve_schema returned: Table Name: payroll.employee_leave_application_m
Description: Transactional table storing leave applications submitted by employees. Business Rule: 'application_status' indicates the state of the leave ('pending', 'approved', 'rejected'). An 'approved' status means the leave is confirmed and days should be deducted from the employee balance.
Schema DDL:
CREATE TABLE payroll.employee_leave_application_m (emp_leave_app_id VARCHAR(255) PRIMARY KEY, employee_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL, leave_template_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL, company_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL, branch_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL, approver_id VARCHAR(255), application_date TIMESTAMP(6) WITHOUT TIME ZONE NOT NULL, start_date TIMESTAMP(6) WITHOUT TIME ZONE NOT NULL, end_date TIMESTAMP(6) WITHOUT TIME ZONE NOT NULL, total_days NUMERIC(38,2), application_status VARCHAR(255) DEFAULT 'pending', hr_remarks VARCHAR(255), application_description VARCHAR(255), application_attachment_url VARCHAR(255), approver_cc VARCHAR(255), created_by VARCHAR(255), creation_date TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE, amended_by VARCHAR(255), amended_date TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE, approver_cc1 VARCHAR(255), approver_cc2 VARCHAR(255), approver_cc3 VARCHAR(255));
Relationships:
Joins with payroll.leave_template_m on leave_template_id to get leave rules. Joins with ta_global.employee_m on employee_id (to get the applicant details) and approver_id (to get the manager details). Joins with ta_global.company_d via company_id.

Table Name: payroll.leave_template_m
Description: Master table defining the rules and configurations for various leave types (e.g., Sick, Casual, Maternity) offered by the company. Business Rule: status = 'A' means the template is active. This table dictates accruals, carry-forward, and encashment limits.
Schema DDL:
CREATE TABLE payroll.leave_template_m (leave_template_id VARCHAR(255) PRIMARY KEY, company_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL, branch_id VARCHAR(255), leave_type VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL, display_name VARCHAR(255), description VARCHAR(255), total_days_in_year INTEGER, accrual_type VARCHAR(255), pro_rata_allocation VARCHAR(255), carry_forward BOOLEAN DEFAULT false, max_carry_forward_days INTEGER, encashment_allowed BOOLEAN DEFAULT false, max_encashment_days INTEGER, sandwich_policy BOOLEAN DEFAULT false, application_policy VARCHAR(255), status VARCHAR(255) DEFAULT 'A', created_by VARCHAR(255), creation_date TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, amended_by VARCHAR(255), amended_date TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE, total_days INTEGER);
Relationships:
Linked to ta_global.company_d via company_id. Linked to ta_global.branch_master via branch_id. Acts as a parent to payroll.employee_leave_application_m via leave_template_id.
